 - add flux-substitutions keys: ghcr_owner, ghcr_pull_auth (base64 user:PAT read:packages), stalkarr_secret, stalkarr_devices (JSON list of box MACs)
 - check Dispatcharr Settings -> Network access lets pod IPs read M3U/EPG/HDHR
 - enable media/playing/stalkarr in services/kustomization.yaml, check flux-services goes Ready and /api/status lists channels
 - set portal background/logo in config.yaml (URL, or file in /data/assets on the PVC)
